<title>SOUTH KOREA: Halla Group in Turkey joint ventures.</title>
<headline>Halla Group in Turkey joint ventures.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Halla Group said on Wednesday it had agreed in principle with Turkey's Cukurova Group to form two separate joint ventures in Turkey to produce automobile parts and newsprint.</p>
<p>A Halla statement said its member firm Mando Machinery Corp would form a $30 million joint venture with Maysan Co Ltd, a unit of Cukurova, to built an automobile parts plant.</p>
<p>In another joint venture, the two conglomerates agreed to build a newsprint mill in Turkey, with an annual production capacity of 170,000 tonnes, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
